# GENERATED by plugin-cursor/scripts/compose.sh — edit core/ or plugin-claude/ then re-compose
"""Kanban lifecycle state machine for synaptory v2.

5-state continuous flow: DISCOVER → READY → EXECUTION → REVIEW → (loop or RELEASE) → COMPLETE.

Used for post-launch maintenance and evolution (brownfield only).
State is stored at .synaptory/.orchestrator/pipeline-state.json.
Delegates story sub-state management to story_pipeline.py.

CLI:
    python3 kanban_state_machine.py init <project_dir> [--backends '{"default":"claude","roles":{}}']
    python3 kanban_state_machine.py read <project_dir>
    python3 kanban_state_machine.py transition <project_dir> <to_state> [--force]
    python3 kanban_state_machine.py pull_ticket <project_dir> <ticket_id> [--title "..."] [--backends '{...}']
    python3 kanban_state_machine.py complete_ticket <project_dir> <ticket_id>
    python3 kanban_state_machine.py transition_story <project_dir> <story_id> <to_state> [--reason "..."] [--force-recovery]
    python3 kanban_state_machine.py evaluate_dod <project_dir> <ticket_id>
    python3 kanban_state_machine.py throughput <project_dir> [--window 7]
    python3 kanban_state_machine.py summary <project_dir>
"""

